KEY COMMANDS:
-- Switch port into access mode --
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10

-- Verify VLANs on switch --
show vlan brief

-- Router interface configuration --
interface g0/0
ip address 10.0.0.62 255.255.255.192
no shutdown

WHAT I LEARNED:
- VLANs separate broadcast domains on one physical switch
- Each VLAN needs its own router interface as gateway
- Switch ports must be manually assigned to VLANs
- Traffic between VLANs must go through the router
- show vlan brief verifies which ports are in which VLAN
